Salo Murn is a translucent human ghost in a butler's uniform, one of the butlers of [[Nos Mortem]]. He appears without warning behind the Party in the manor's Eastern Hall and offers to help them.

He says the run of the manor is theirs except for the doorway to the basement in the Western Hall. He calls [[Syrin]] the footman a little slow, but a pleasant chap.
